elated to restaurant menus,\ndishes, ingredients, allergens, dietary preferences, price, cuisine,\nor food ordering.\n\nThis tool should politely redirect the user back to food/menu-related help.', 'parameters': {'properties': {'query': {'type': 'string'}}, 'required': ['query'], 'type': 'object'}}}]}}
